		(property "Description" "Adafruit MCP23017 16-bit I2C GPIO expander breakout, STEMMA QT (product 5346). Default I2C address 0x20 (A0-A2 pulled low on the module); RESET pulled up on the module. Headers: 1x5 power/I2C, 1x5 INT/address, 1x8 GPA, 1x8 GPB (the two 1x8 GND rows are not used)."
